control: A reopened first pass always leads to a run of the second pass
removes: the run-start step reopens the second pass only when it returned a verdict or a skip to pending or masked a subject again, not when a subject stored masked leaves the first pass due again
packages: ./worker/internal/backfill
tests: TestAReopenedFirstPassLeadsToASecondPass
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

